{"id":"636235","name":"烤饺子","author":"@那时花开@","authorId":"91713","desc":"","cover":"images/636235/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"速冻饺子","amount":"10个"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"几滴"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"速冻饺子无需解冻。","img":"images/636235/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"把速冻饺子摆入锅里（表面喷点油外皮会更酥脆）。","img":"images/636235/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"先180度10分钟。","img":"images/636235/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"饺子自身也会烤些油出来。","img":"images/636235/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"喜欢酥脆口感的可以再多烤几分钟。","img":"images/636235/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"延长时间就多看看以免烤糊。","img":"images/636235/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"饺子皮边边真的很脆。","img":"images/636235/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"蘸上料汁会更香。","img":"images/636235/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"花生米喷少许油180度8分钟左右。","img":"images/636235/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：空气炸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}